---
import iconChevron from '@tabler/icons/outline/chevron-down.svg?raw';
const chevron = iconChevron.replace('<svg', '<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"');
---
<section class="desk-tile jev-m5 reveal" style="--i: 6" id="jev-m5-panel" aria-labelledby="jev-m5-title" hidden>
  <div class="desk-tile__head">
    <div>
      <p class="desk-kicker">Gold M5 · Jev decision layer</p>
      <h2 id="jev-m5-title">Jev decisions & results</h2>
      <p class="desk-muted small m-0">Veto activity and separate shadow qualification</p>
    </div>
    <p class="m-0"><span class="visually-hidden">Jev mode: </span><span class="desk-chip" id="jev-m5-mode">Checking mode</span></p>
  </div>
  <h3 class="desk-subhead">Demo veto activity</h3>
  <p id="jev-m5-veto-summary" role="status">Loading veto activity…</p>
  <p class="desk-num" id="jev-m5-veto-results">—</p>
  <p class="desk-muted small">Blocked means no order was submitted. The reason distinguishes Jev decisions from other entry safeguards. Submitted does not guarantee a fill.</p>
  <details class="desk-disclosure">
    <summary>Veto receipts and recent decisions <Fragment set:html={chevron} /></summary>
    <p class="desk-num small" id="jev-m5-veto-receipts">—</p>
    <ol class="small" id="jev-m5-veto-recent"></ol>
    <p class="desk-muted small">Latest 20 decisions, newest first; times identify the M5 candle in UTC. Missing P/L is not zero.</p>
  </details>
  <h3 class="desk-subhead">Shadow qualification</h3>
  <p class="desk-muted small">Veto trades are excluded from this comparison and do not advance the 50-trade gate.</p>
  <p id="jev-m5-summary" role="status">Loading the M5 scorecard…</p>
  <p class="desk-muted small" id="jev-m5-updated"></p>
  <dl class="desk-stats">
    <div><dt>Jev kept · avg net / trade</dt><dd class="desk-num jev-m5-pl" id="jev-m5-kept" data-tone="none">—</dd></div>
    <div><dt>All trades · avg net / trade</dt><dd class="desk-num jev-m5-pl" id="jev-m5-all" data-tone="none">—</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Jev vetoed · avg net / trade</dt><dd class="desk-num jev-m5-pl" id="jev-m5-vetoed" data-tone="none">—</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Shared Jev budget</dt><dd class="desk-num" id="jev-m5-budget">— of $5.00 left</dd></div>
  </dl>
  <h3 class="desk-subhead">Veto gate</h3>
  <p class="m-0" id="jev-m5-verdict">Gate unavailable</p>
  <ul class="desk-gates jev-m5-checks" id="jev-m5-checks"></ul>
  <details class="desk-disclosure">
    <summary>Shadow receipt health <Fragment set:html={chevron} /></summary>
    <p class="desk-num small" id="jev-m5-receipts">—</p>
    <p class="desk-num small" id="jev-m5-counts">—</p>
  </details>
  <p class="desk-callout small mb-0">Demo only. Jev can block an entry; it never opens one.</p>
</section>
<script>
  import { mountJevM5 } from '../scripts/trading-jev-m5.mjs';
  mountJevM5(document, window);
</script>
<style>
  /* Desk tokens only (DESIGN.md, Trading exception). Colour always pairs with a sign, arrow or Met / Not met text. */
  .jev-m5[hidden] { display: none; }
  .jev-m5-pl[data-tone='up'] { color: var(--desk-green); }
  .jev-m5-pl[data-tone='down'] { color: var(--desk-red); }
  .jev-m5-pl[data-tone='none'] { color: var(--desk-muted); }
  .jev-m5-checks { list-style: none; padding-left: 0; }
  .jev-m5-checks :global(li::before) { margin-inline-end: var(--desk-space-sm); }
  .jev-m5-checks :global(li[data-met='true']::before) { content: '✓' / ''; color: var(--desk-green); }
  .jev-m5-checks :global(li[data-met='false']::before) { content: '✗' / ''; color: var(--desk-muted); }
  .jev-m5 summary { min-height: var(--desk-touch-target); }
  .jev-m5 summary:focus-visible { outline: calc(var(--desk-hairline) * 2) solid var(--desk-green); outline-offset: var(--desk-hairline); }
</style>
